      "content": "The Marvel Comics API allows developers to access information about Marvel's extensive catalog of characters, comics, creators, events, series, and stories. All requests must be authenticated using a public key, timestamp, and MD5 hash of the timestamp + private key + public key, supplied as query parameters.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Marvel Developer Portal",
